  "description": "Activates on \"water\"/\"Water\" across lists, ingredients, and environmental descriptions, and on tokens at the boundary before eleven-related continuations. The second pattern includes contexts eliciting 11/eleven, November as the eleventh month, K as the eleventh English letter, or XI as the eleventh positive integer. Activation may occur on a preceding word, separator, or assistant-prefix token rather than the number itself; it is wording-dependent and sometimes appears for neighboring ordinals.",
